Single-database Alembic configuration for the Month 02 Ticket API.

Run commands from the repository root with the project `alembic.ini`. Local
migration exercises must set `ALEMBIC_DATABASE_NAME=opsdesk_migration_dev` so
they do not mutate the populated `opsdesk_dev` database. The connection URL is
loaded from secret-aware application settings and must not be added to Git.
